    "name": "Autocrats",
    "steam_appid": 2701140,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701140/extras/04a3402c24af064ba0ef95f23197ffd5.avif?t=1749653653\" width=630 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Autocrats is currently in development. Updates to the game will be released as a demo and for free on Steam. You can support the game by adding it to your wishlist and following the game. You can also share your feedback on our Discord server and Reddit subreddit.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Autocrats, First-Person Government Simulation Game</strong> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701140/extras/fec4390faa8caf5944bb4f6605c41ec4.avif?t=1749653653\" width=630 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish your own nation and rule like an autocrat. Work for the well-being of your citizens or wage war for global hegemony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udea9 Assignment \ud83d\udea9</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity united under the World Republic after global crises. While the World Republic was healing the wounds of humanity, it began building its future. It increased efforts in space colonization. As a result, Earth-like planets were discovered. MORA was one of them, and colonies were established on it. Under the orders of the World Republic, you have been assigned to establish and manage a colony on MORA.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Gameplay \ud83c\udfae </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features two modes: First-Person and Government. You can switch between these modes. Both are used to establish, develop, and govern your nation.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udec5 <u>First-Person:</u> Used for constructing your nation, searching for resources, and establishing new colonies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f <u>Government:</u> Used for making political decisions, nation-building, resource management, production, diplomacy, and military control.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0d MORA \ud83c\udf0d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mora is an Earth-like planet that hosts human colonies. Beyond the colonies, it has vast, untouched lands rich in resources. Players can fulfill their vital needs through the colonies. However, as survival outside the colonies is impossible, players must stock up on supplies before venturing out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udccb Key Features \ud83d\udccb </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-Person Gameplay</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Government Simulation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open World</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >City Building</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource Management</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Autocrats, First-Person Government Simulation Game</strong> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2701140/extras/fec4390faa8caf5944bb4f6605c41ec4.avif?t=1749653653\" width=630 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish your own nation and rule like an autocrat. Work for the well-being of your citizens or wage war for global hegemony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udea9 Assignment \ud83d\udea9</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity united under the World Republic after global crises. While the World Republic was healing the wounds of humanity, it began building its future. It increased efforts in space colonization. As a result, Earth-like planets were discovered. MORA was one of them, and colonies were established on it. Under the orders of the World Republic, you have been assigned to establish and manage a colony on MORA.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Gameplay \ud83c\udfae </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features two modes: First-Person and Government. You can switch between these modes. Both are used to establish, develop, and govern your nation.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udec5 <u>First-Person:</u> Used for constructing your nation, searching for resources, and establishing new colonies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f <u>Government:</u> Used for making political decisions, nation-building, resource management, production, diplomacy, and military control.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0d MORA \ud83c\udf0d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mora is an Earth-like planet that hosts human colonies. Beyond the colonies, it has vast, untouched lands rich in resources. Players can fulfill their vital needs through the colonies. However, as survival outside the colonies is impossible, players must stock up on supplies before venturing out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udccb Key Features \ud83d\udccb </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-Person Gameplay</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Government Simulation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open World</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >City Building</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource Management</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Autocrats is a first-person government simulation game. Build and develop your own country in an open world on first-person mode. Manage your resources, train your army and declare war on other countries. Establish diplomatic relations and form alliances.",
